Air elementals do 2d10 damage when engulfed _at speed 36_. You'll find the
potential for having 150HP slurped off you when Burdened is just as great
as the danger posed by the High Priest. You weren't ascension-ready; you
were lucky.

>The discussion has long got beyond the point of boredom; to explain apparent
